WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:17,600
Huh, I just dreamed about the fact that we would lose our money after this road.

2
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:28,330
Wife, you are asleep. This is just a dream. Drink some water and calm down.

3
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:33,580
But what you said is right. Sometimes it can be quite evil. Let’s change the route.

4
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:38,510
Yes, yes. Maybe it was a reminder from God.

5
00:00:38,510 --> 00:00:40,510
Xiaoxiao, I didn’t scare you, did I?

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:43,510
No, don’t worry, Sister Wang. I’m very brave.
